---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Projects | Amierul Faiz" description="Selected projects focused on IoT efficiency and practical automation.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mb-10 max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-cyan-400">Selected Work</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-5xl">
        Portfolio Projects
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
        A set of cybersecurity-focused and secure systems projects—spanning CTFs, secure access control,
        wireless security simulations, and practical secure applications.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-8 shadow-lg shadow-black/20">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Mini CTF Platform</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Built a gamified ethical hacking platform using Linux containers for over 120 users.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Created Capture the Flag (CTF) challenges focused on Web Exploitation and Cryptography.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-8 shadow-lg shadow-black/20">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Secure RBAC System</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Set up Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) to block unauthorized access.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Reduced data exposure risks by 85% and fixed XSS network vulnerabilities.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-8 shadow-lg shadow-black/20">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Wireless Security Simulations</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Ran a Wi‑Fi phishing simulation using an ESP8266 microcontroller to harvest login credentials securely
          and demonstrate weaknesses in standard protocols.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Used an ESP8266 deauther to clone wireless networks and perform targeted attacks, proving how easily
          standard connections can be disrupted.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-8 shadow-lg shadow-black/20">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Secure POS System</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Built a secure Point of Sale (POS) system using Laravel for 15 daily users.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Added authentication rules that reduced transaction errors by 30% and improved daily work efficiency.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-8 shadow-lg shadow-black/20">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Smart Home Garbage Monitoring</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Constructed an IoT solution using three sensor modules to monitor waste securely.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Won a Gold Award at IDPEX out of more than 20 entries.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/80 p-8 shadow-lg shadow-black/20">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Lost and Found Database System</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Designed a secure SQL database to register and track over 100 items.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
          Won a Gold Award at EREKA against 30 other project participants.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
